1. **Explicit `encoding="utf-8"` & `newline="\n"`**: Prevents `UnicodeDecodeError` on Windows (`\r\n` vs `\n`) and cross-platform portability.
2. **`try/except json.JSONDecodeError`**: Gracefully skips malformed lines instead of crashing.
3. **`Path` & `dataclass`**: Immutable, thread-safe result container with clear type hints.

